{"id":186,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と協働で実践力を育む実践女子","feature_description":"実践女子学園は、知識を身につけるだけでなく活用し行動に移す「実践力」を重視します。探究教育では好奇心と基礎学力を育て、他者との関わりから問いを生み出す学びを進めます。中1から高2までの「未来デザイン」は、持続可能な開発やグローバルシチズンシップを基盤に調査・対話・発表を重ねる探究授業です。感性表現教育やグローバル教育も柱とし、協働や体験を通して将来に向かう力を養います。","clubs":[{"id":3265,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/sports.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3266,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/sports.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3267,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/sports.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3268,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/sports.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3269,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/sports.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3270,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/performing_arts.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3271,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/performing_arts.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3272,"name":"室内楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/performing_arts.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3273,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/performing_arts.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3274,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/performing_arts.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3276,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/performing_arts.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3277,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://hs.jissen.ac.jp/life/club/performing_arts.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3278,"name":"華道部小原流","ca